<title>UK: B.A.T confident on U.S. nicotine documents.</title>
<headline>B.A.T confident on U.S. nicotine documents.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>British tobacco and insurance group B.A.T Industries Plc on Thursday said it was confident that U.S. investigators would not find a &quot;smoking gun&quot; that would show it believed nicotine in cigarettes was addictive.</p>
<p>&quot;We have gone through a very detailed discovery process. Millions of millions of documents have been made available to the plaintiffs attorneys in the U.S.,&quot; said B.A.T spokesman Ralph Edmondson.</p>
<p>&quot;I don't believe there is anything else to emerge.&quot;</p>
</text>
